    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνράπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sew up in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυβλίον εἰς ἡνίαν χαλινοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					31.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				25
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διόνυσον ἐνερράψατο ἐς τὸν
				μηρόν</span> into <i>his</i> thigh, <i><span class="en">
